# Generated from this project's manifest and this machine's hardware: core count,
# memory, and which devices the host actually has. Committing it would carry one
# machine's answers to every other, where a --device against a path that does not
# exist is a hard failure. The extension warns on every open while this is
# missing.
.devcontainer/devcontainer.json
# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/
*.gate.lock*
# Dependencies, wherever a package is installed in this monorepo.
node_modules/
# Everything the site's build and tests produce.
site/dist/
site/e2e/.features-gen/
site/e2e/test-results/
site/e2e/playwright-report/
site/test-results/
site/e2e/.features-gen-deployed/
# Game images: fetched and verified by the build, never committed (docs/RULES.md).
site/.cache/
site/public/game/
